{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of Baikal \u2014 </strong>a heartfelt visual novel about family, memory, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young woman traveling with her father to Lake Baikal \u2014 a place tied to their family\u2019s past. On the way, a storm stands in their path, while an old photo album brings back memories of childhood, joy and loss, quarrels and reconciliation.<br>Will you find harmony in the storm of emotions?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfac A personal and emotional story about the road, relationships, growing up, and memory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 A linear narrative focused on the heroine</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Two art styles: pixel art combined with a hand-drawn style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for those who love emotional visual novels like <i>To the Moon</i> or <i>Clannad</i>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Memory One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967480/6088f2f39c754c551c8d69b096dc6a6838deed1e.jpg"},{"name":"Memory Two","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967480/0b19b43598240ffbe05cac0f64f347e3302883bb.jpg"},{"name":"Memory Three","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967480/b72f3d1c82fa8a8f9983180540852d0f3674b8a0.jpg"},{"name":"Memory Four","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967480/226e4f27e840beb48bb3f4abe027798f0bcaec3f.jpg"},{"name":"Road to Baikal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967480/b2caa48aef4a860ee47c13917db9f8348903be2e.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967480?t=177276213